    {
      "s": "The Press Secretary in not an official Cabinet position, so they’d be keeping their hemorrhoid cream elsewhere.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "738381_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "But it’s not like they couldn’t make some room in there.   I mean, does the Secretary of Agriculture really need that MANY jars of Vick’s VapoRub?",
